Subject: [PATCH 01242/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for DECENTRALIZATION
 stronger-base -- COLLECT+VALIDATE (G3): poll the backgrounded run from
 exp4036; report whether the stronger local base's best-of-N demo-perfect
 coverage rises above exp4012's 0.2581 (gemma-4-12B) ceiling. Diagnose:
 coverage rises materially (CI excludes the 0.2581 baseline) -> the
 abstraction is LATENT in the larger local model -> distillation/RLVR viable,
 the sovereign path scales with base size; coverage stays flat -> the
 abstraction is ABSENT (the Invisible Leash holds) -> sovereignty needs a
 still-stronger base, not more training. Report the cost (local seconds vs
 codex 46s/task; the model-free verifier is ~free). Honest negative is a
 COMPLETE verdict.

